          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પાછા મળીશું = પાછા (pāchhā, \"again\") + મળીશું (maḷīshũ, \"we will meet\") — \"we'll meet again.\" Where Chapter 1's આવજો (āvjo) is the quick, warm \"come again,\" pāchhā maḷīshũ spells out the promise: we will meet once more. It is the same \"promise of return\" the whole subcontinent prefers (Hindi phir milenge, Bengali āshi, Tamil pōy varugiṟēṉ)."
            }
